[PlaitOS: ported from LineageOS frameworks_base lineage-24.0. The System UI Tuner
keeps its stock "Time" entry (seconds / hours and minutes / hidden), which
writes the same "clock" icon_blacklist entry, so the tuner and cm_strings
hunks are dropped]
